sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Triage router
    participant M as Inbox manager
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant LLM as Model (MANAGER_LLM)
    participant Gmail as Gmail (IMAP)
    participant Cal as Google Calendar
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant T as Trace file

    R->>M: handle(message)
    M->>Mem: preferences block (recall)
    loop up to MAX_ROUNDS
        M->>LLM: skill + memory + the email, category's tools bound
        alt tool call
            LLM-->>M: get_thread / search_threads / now
            M->>Gmail: read
        else auto_schedule tool call
            LLM-->>M: invite_details, find_calendar_events, create_reminder, respond_to_invite
            M->>Gmail: text/calendar part of the email
            M->>Cal: find event by UID, create event, or set RSVP
        else auto_draft tool call
            LLM-->>M: save_draft
            M->>Gmail: APPEND to Drafts, threaded on the email
        else not allowed for this category
            M-->>LLM: refused, list of allowed tools
        else no tool call
            LLM-->>M: closing sentence
        end
    end
    M->>M: action = write tools' results, or "no action: ..."
    M->>DB: save email with action
    M->>T: inbox_manager line (action, tools used)
    M-->>R: message
